In dissect_diameter_base_framed_ipv6_prefix, prefix_len is read straight from the AVP as a guint8 (0-255) and never validated against the IPv6 maximum of 128. prefix_len_bytes = ceil(prefix_len/8) can then reach 32, so tvb_memcpy() copies up to 32 bytes into the 16-byte stack buffer value.bytes, and value.bytes[prefix_len_bytes] is indexed out of bounds. A crafted Framed-IPv6-Prefix AVP with length > 128 therefore causes a stack buffer overflow in the dissector.</root_cause>
